<section id="about" class="py-32 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Left -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-violet-500/30 bg-violet-500/10 text-violet-300 text-xs font-medium mb-6 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] uppercase tracking-widest">
          // about_me
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-white mb-6">
          Building <span class="gradient-text">Intelligent</span><br />Enterprise Systems
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] leading-relaxed mb-5">
          I'm a Staff Software Engineer and Solutions Architect at <span class="text-white font-semibold">ServiceNow</span>, where I design and deliver scalable enterprise solutions that power next-generation IT operations. With 8+ years in the ServiceNow ecosystem, I specialise in bridging complex business requirements with elegant platform solutions.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] leading-relaxed mb-5">
          My work spans the full spectrum — from architecting <span class="text-violet-400 font-semibold">autonomous AI agent systems</span> and building custom scoped applications, to developing sophisticated integrations via REST, SOAP, PowerShell, SSH, and JDBC. I thrive at the intersection of platform engineering and AI.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] leading-relaxed">
          Currently, I'm driving AIOps LEAP and autonomous IT capabilities at ServiceNow, and building Python + React-based intelligent analytics platforms with <span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">GenAI-assisted development</span> — including leveraging Claude Code to accelerate design and implementation cycles.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {['Pune, India', 'ServiceNow', '8+ Years', 'CTA Certified'].map(tag => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#13131a] border border-violet-500/20 text-[#9b9aaa] text-sm">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Highlights -->
      <div class="space-y-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s">
        <div class="card-surface rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-violet-500/15 border border-violet-500/25 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">
              🤖
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Agentic AI & Automation</h3>
              <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] text-sm leading-relaxed">Built autonomous agent systems using Now Assist and AI-driven workflows. Implemented AIOps LEAP for intelligent event correlation and self-healing operations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-surface rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/15 border border-cyan-500/25 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">
              🏗️
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Platform Architecture</h3>
              <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] text-sm leading-relaxed">Designed Deployment Configuration Health Analyzer adopted by 100+ DemoHub engineers. Architected cross-BU solutions for ITSM, ITOM, CSM, and SPM modules.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-surface rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/25 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">
              ⚡
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Performance Engineering</h3>
              <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] text-sm leading-relaxed">Achieved 50%+ improvement in ServiceNow instance performance through deep analysis and tuning. Led technical governance for quality across distributed teams.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-surface rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-500/15 border border-green-500/25 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">
              🔗
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Enterprise Integrations</h3>
              <p class="text-[#9b9aaa] text-sm leading-relaxed">Built integrations spanning SAP HANA, Rapid7, MS Azure, OpsRamp, Cloud Insights and MS Teams — using REST, SOAP, JDBC, PowerShell, SSH, and Python.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
